# sprintf-js unbounded precision specifier denial of service (GHSA-hp3w-g68c-fv3c), via packages/www -> gray-matter@4.0.3 -> js-yaml@3.15.2 -> argparse@1.0.10 -> sprintf-js@1.0.3.
